@PropFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5050

# Authentication Endpoints

### Register a new landlord
POST {{PropFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}

### Login (Test with existing user)
POST {{PropFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@test.com",
  "password": "Cnzmws"
}

### Get current user (requires authentication - replace YOUR_JWT_TOKEN)
GET {{PropFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

# Properties Endpoints

### Get all properties (requires authentication - replace YOUR_JWT_TOKEN)
GET {{PropFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/properties
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Create a new property (requires authentication - replace YOUR_JWT_TOKEN)
POST {{PropFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/properties
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Sample Property",
  "address": "123 Main Street",
  "city": "San José",
  "country": "Costa Rica",
  "notes": "Beautiful property in downtown"
}

# Dashboard Endpoint

### Get dashboard summary (requires authentication - replace YOUR_JWT_TOKEN)
GET {{PropFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

# Health Check

### API Health Check (No auth required)
GET {{PropFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html
Accept: text/html
